                        </ul>

                        <h1 class="c-article-title" data-test="article-title" data-article-title="">Accelerated antimicrobial discovery via deep generative models and molecular dynamics simulations</h1>
                        <ul class="c-article-author-list c-article-author-list--short" data-test="authors-list" data-component-authors-activator="authors-list"><li class="c-article-author-list__item"><a data-test="author-name" data-track="click" data-track-action="open author" data-track-label="link" data-track-index="1_15" data-track-context="researcher popup with no profile" href="#auth-Payel-Das-Aff1-Aff2" data-author-popup="auth-Payel-Das-Aff1-Aff2" data-author-search="Das, Payel" data-corresp-id="c1">Payel Das<svg width="16" height="16" focusable="false" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="u-icon"><use xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="#icon-eds-i-mail-medium"></use></svg></a><span class="u-js-hide"> 
            <a class="js-orcid" href="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7288-0516"><span class="u-visually-hidden">ORCID: </span>orcid.org/0000-0002-7288-0516</a></span><sup class="u-js-hide"><a href="#Aff1">1</a>,<a href="#Aff2">2</a></sup>, </li><li class="c-article-author-list__item"><a data-test="author-name" data-track="click" data-track-action="open author" data-track-label="link" data-track-index="2_15" data-track-context="researcher popup with no profile" href="#auth-Tom-Sercu-Aff1-Aff9" data-author-popup="auth-Tom-Sercu-Aff1-Aff9" data-author-search="Sercu, Tom">Tom Sercu</a><sup class="u-js-hide"><a href="#Aff1">1</a></sup><sup class="u-js-hide"> <a href="#nAff9">nAff9</a></sup>, </li><li class="c-article-author-list__item c-article-author-list__item--hide-small-screen"><a data-test="author-name" data-track="click" data-track-action="open author" data-track-label="link" data-track-index="3_15" data-track-context="researcher popup with no profile" href="#auth-Kahini-Wadhawan-Aff1" data-author-popup="auth-Kahini-Wadhawan-Aff1" data-author-search="Wadhawan, Kahini">Kahini Wadhawan</a><sup class="u-js-hide"><a href="#Aff1">1</a></sup><sup class="u-js-hide"> <a href="#na1">na1</a></sup>, </li><li class="c-article-author-list__item c-article-author-list__item--hide-small-screen"><a data-test="author-name" data-track="click" data-track-action="open author" data-track-label="link" data-track-index="4_15" data-track-context="researcher popup with no profile" href="#auth-Inkit-Padhi-Aff1" data-author-popup="auth-Inkit-Padhi-Aff1" data-author-search="Padhi, Inkit">Inkit Padhi</a><sup class="u-js-hide"><a href="#Aff1">1</a></sup><sup class="u-js-hide"> <a href="#na1">na1</a></sup>, </li><li class="c-article-author-list__item c-article-author-list__item--hide-small-screen"><a data-test="author-name" data-track="click" data-track-action="open author" data-track-label="link" data-track-index="5_15" data-track-context="researcher popup with no profile" href="#auth-Sebastian-Geh